#: admin/views/pages/parts/slider-settings.php:848
msgid "Carousel Mode"
msgstr "Режим карусели"

#: admin/views/pages/parts/slider-settings.php:853
msgid ""
"Display multiple slides at once. The slideshow output will default to using "
"100% width and the 'Slide' Transition Effect."
msgstr ""
